# Project Audit — Bas Ek Chai (B.Tech Student Survival Guide)

**Audit date:** 2026-10-24
**Template:** bolt-vite-react-ts
**Auditor:** Automated code review

---

## 1. Overview

A single-page React + TypeScript app themed around Indian B.Tech student life. It curates cafes, hangouts, social events, and relaxation spots, includes a "Roast Generator," and an "SOS" form. All content is static and hardcoded — there is no backend, database, or auth.

| Aspect | Value |
|---|---|
| Framework | React 18.3 + TypeScript 5.5 |
| Build tool | Vite 5.4 |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS 3.4 (custom theme) |
| Icons | lucide-react 0.446 |
| State | In-memory React state only |
| Persistence | None (data is hardcoded in `src/data/content.ts`) |

